# Test output must never reach the site root. frontend/ is what the static host publishes, so a
# stray screenshot from a Playwright run lands at a public URL. Two boot-screen shots got here
# that way, from a run whose working directory happened to be frontend/. Real image assets belong
# in frontend/assets/, which this does not touch.
frontend/*.png
